# Build-context filter for docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# Keep the context to what `dotnet publish` of the web host needs.
**/bin/
**/obj/
.git/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
storage/
# tools/ only for its npm manifest (the image installs the Linux Tailwind CSS CLI itself from it), no npm packages, and
# not the compiled stylesheet (the image's build compiles it).
tools/*
!tools/package.json
!tools/package-lock.json
**/node_modules/
src/DotNetForge.UI/wwwroot/dnf.css
tests/
TestResults/
.docs/
.claude/
*.md
